  "description": "Think you can make it to the end? Blood-thirsty spirits, vicious curses, and sickening twists haunt these individual horror stories from 29 different creators. Scroll if you dare. But whatever you do, don’t scroll alone! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\nStories featured:\n1) **Neulpureun yoyangwon** (늘푸른 요양원 - Evergreen Nursing Home) by Ryoung)\n2) **Gosulsa** (고술사 - The Shaman) by Hwang Jun-Ho\n3) **Bidulgi** (비둘기 - Pigeon) by Hoodbird\n4) **Jasing nongsa** (자식 농사 - Raising a Success) by Mangsoon\n5) **Boinda**(보인다 - I See You) by Kim Lee-Yeon\n6) **Junggogeorae** (중고거래 - Buying Used)by Kingsnal/Jui-Joo\n7) **Geugeotdeul** (그것들 - Them) by Cyclops/Kim Do-yeon\n8) **Uri gajok** (우리 가족 - My Family) by Su Ri-bu\n9) **Gongpoui Saengdongseong** (공포의 생동성 - The horror of Vitality) by Jin Ja/Jeong Saeng\n10) **Sungnyeokkeseoneun Bimireul Sireohasinda** (숙녀께서는 비밀을 싫어하신다 - The Lady Hate Secrets) by Go Tae-ho\n11) **Angwi** (안귀 - The Eye Phantom) by Aeon\n12) **Hum** (훔 - Hum) by Lee Su-Min\n13) **Back Rooms no.0605** (Back Rooms no.0605 - Backrooms no.0605) by Won Ju-Min\n14) **Mimi** (미미 - Mimi) by Im Mok-won\n15) **Mising** (미싱 - The Sewing Machine) by Huinari\n16) **Sikkeureoun Jip** (시끄러운 집 - Noisy Tenants) by Digeut\n17) **Meori** (머리) by Sam-Chon\n18) **Mongyubyeong** (몽유병) by bunny\n19) **Hosu Gongwonui Yeoja** (호수 공원의 여자) by Spring\n20) **Popi Mom** (뽀삐맘) by Gong Yuk\n21) **Geokkuro Seoneun ja** (거꾸로 서는 자) by Dan-woo\n22) **Doro Wiui Angma** (도로 위의 악마) by Lee Daeyang\n23) **Gyedan, Mureup, Dalmasian** (계단, 무릎, 달마시안) by Mapache\n24) **Suhagyeohaeng** (수학여행) by Seo Irae/ Yeong-I Yeong\n25) **Misikga** (미식가) by 247\n26) **Inganui joe** (인간의 죄) by Seon Taek-gil\n27) **Mijiwaui Jou** (미지와의 조우) by Kim Yong-Ki\n28) **Bulchibyeong** (불치병) by Rangddo\n29) **Busan Noraebang Gwisin** (부산 노래방 귀신 - The Busan Karaoke Ghost) by Horang",
